Feed Query Optimization (Quan trọng)

Feed phải tránh N+1 query.

Cách làm:

Bước 1 — lấy danh sách posts
SELECT *
FROM COMMUNITY_POST
WHERE status = 1
ORDER BY createAt DESC
OFFSET @offset ROWS
FETCH NEXT @pageSize ROWS ONLY
Bước 2 — lấy media cho toàn bộ posts
SELECT *
FROM COMMUNITY_POST_MEDIA
WHERE communityPostId IN (@postIds)
Bước 3 — lấy comment count
SELECT communityPostId, COUNT(*) AS commentCount
FROM COMMENT
WHERE communityPostId IN (@postIds)
GROUP BY communityPostId
Bước 4 — lấy favorite status của user
SELECT communityPostId
FROM COMMUNITY_POST_FAVORITE
WHERE userId = @currentUserId
AND communityPostId IN (@postIds)
Bước 5 — lấy saved status
SELECT communityPostId
FROM COMMUNITY_POST_SAVE
WHERE userId = @currentUserId
AND communityPostId IN (@postIds)
